OL,3,AIsrael confirms it opened fire on
OL,4,Avehicle carrying five-year-old Hind
OL,5,ARajab in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military has confirmed for
OL,8,Fthe first time that it opened fire on a
OL,9,Fvehicle carrying five-year-old Hind
OL,10,FRajab and six members of her family in
OL,11,FGaza City during the war in Gaza.
OL,13,FThe Palestinian child initially
OL,14,Fsurvived the attack in January 2024
OL,15,Fthat killed several family members, but
OL,16,Fher body was recovered days later along
OL,17,Fwith her relatives.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
