OL,3,AIsrael confirms it opened fire on
OL,4,Avehicle carrying five-year-old Hind
OL,5,ARajab in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter the attack, Hind managed to
OL,8,Fanswer a telephone call from the
OL,9,FPalestinian Red Crescent Society, which
OL,10,Flasted hours. An ambulance it sent to
OL,11,Freach her ` in a move coordinated with
OL,12,Fthe Israeli army - was then shelled,
OL,13,Fkilling two paramedics.
OL,15,FIn a statement, the Israel Defense
OL,16,FForces (IDF) said that following a
OL,17,Freview it would be opening a criminal
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
